      "The Mesoamerican Initiative of Women Human Rights Defenders (IM-Defensoras) and FIDH documented her community activism, detention, and murder.",
      "The killers and any intellectual authors remain unidentified in official records, leaving the murder judicially unsolved with no convictions."
